# Lita's Alliance (CR 700.2, 603.3c): "Whenever another creature you control enters, choose one that hasn't been chosen this
# turn." Lita comes down on turn 1 and does not trigger for herself ("another"). On turn 3 Bot1 casts Savannah Lions (a +1/+1
# counter on Lita), a second Lions (the +1/+1 counter is refused: already chosen this turn; a Food token), Elite Vanguard (scry 1:
# Mountain to the bottom; the last mode needs no choice) and then Ornithopter: all three modes are spent, so that instance is removed from the stack with
# no effect. Bot2's Elvish Mystic entering on turn 2 triggers nothing ("you control").

